# tally 2.3.1 S4, #253 item 4 (L §5.11: a cycle in beats across the versions of the def's rules is
# LOAD-CYCLE): b beats a in v, v2's replacing a beats b; no day has both, the cycle is refused. Unchanged:
# a guard.
=== beats_ver.tally
model beats_ver
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "invented"

def d: int at reader
  rule a = 1
  rule b beats a = 2

ask q1: d law 2026-03-01
ask q2: d law 2026-09-01

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..2026-06-30
  known 2026-01-01

version v2
  cite s
  governs 2026-07-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace rule d.a beats b = 3
=== expect
refused: LOAD-CYCLE a beats cycle in d: a -> b -> a (beats_ver.tally:9)
